@MiniBank.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

### Hello
GET {{MiniBank.Api_HostAddress}}/hello
Accept: application/json

### List all accounts
GET {{MiniBank.Api_HostAddress}}/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Withdraw: success (expect 200 + updated account)
POST {{MiniBank.Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50.25 }

### Withdraw: overdraft (David has $95.50, expect 400)
POST {{MiniBank.Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/4/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 500 }

### Withdraw: negative amount (expect 400)
POST {{MiniBank.Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": -20 }

### Withdraw: unknown account (expect 404)
POST {{MiniBank.Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/999/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 10 }

### Withdraw: malformed body (expect automatic 400 from [ApiController])
POST {{MiniBank.Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": "lots" }
